{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Now you shall see.</b> Now that you have seen Pharaoh's rebellion — exerting himself to hold Israel fast with the rod of his fury — you shall see that with a strong hand He will send them: he will exert himself, out of restraint of evil and grief, to send them away with all his might." "<b>And with a strong hand he will drive them out of his land.</b> Corresponding to how he has now scattered Israel throughout all the land of Egypt, he will exert himself to drive them out of his land, so that not even one of them remains at all."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:32.595591978Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}